# IPv4 literal (18) fires; plain text (19) must not
hardcoded-ip-address 18
!hardcoded-ip-address 19
# 2026-09-16: a VERSION-named const holding a dotted quad is NOT an address (7, 8);
# a const that is not version-named still is (10) -- the positive control for the
# #not-in? predicate, without which the rule stays silent on every const or fires on all
hardcoded-ip-address 10
!hardcoded-ip-address 7
!hardcoded-ip-address 8
